      "writtenOn": "2017-12-28T17:20:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note that not using aligned host commands will expand code size on the master by 1-3KB.\n\nThat may be ok for the current board, but it is likely to cause problems in the future.\n\nI thought you were going to pad out the packets to 32-bit boundaries?",
